{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"申命記","commonName":"申命記","title":"申命記","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"4a98ab64316df301207d28935cf308fe8032792737350a017363e19134af391f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":951},"chapter":{"number":34,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西去世"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["摩西從摩押平原登尼波山，上了那與耶利哥相對的毗斯迦山頂。耶和華把基列全地直到但，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["拿弗他利全地，以法蓮、瑪拿西的地，猶大全地直到西海，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["南地和棕樹城耶利哥的平原，直到瑣珥，都指給他看。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華對他說：「這就是我向亞伯拉罕、以撒、雅各起誓應許之地，說：『我必將這地賜給你的後裔。』現在我使你眼睛看見了，你卻不得過到那裏去。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["於是，耶和華的僕人摩西死在摩押地，正如耶和華所說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華將他埋葬在摩押地、伯‧毗珥對面的谷中，只是到今日沒有人知道他的墳墓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["摩西死的時候年一百二十歲；眼目沒有昏花，精神沒有衰敗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["以色列人在摩押平原為摩西哀哭了三十日，為摩西居喪哀哭的日子就滿了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["嫩的兒子約書亞；因為摩西曾按手在他頭上，就被智慧的靈充滿，以色列人便聽從他，照着耶和華吩咐摩西的行了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["以後以色列中再沒有興起先知像摩西的。他是耶和華面對面所認識的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華打發他在埃及地向法老和他的一切臣僕，並他的全地，行各樣神蹟奇事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又在以色列眾人眼前顯大能的手，行一切大而可畏的事。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/34.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/33.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}